<title>HUNGARY: Hungary two-yr govt bond yield drops to 20.99 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary two-yr govt bond yield drops to 20.99 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungary's two-year government bonds was set by auction at 20.99 percent, down from 21.99 percent at an auction one month ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday.    BONDS OF 1998/K SERIES</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    16,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     30,755 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   20,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		22,400 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.99 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		    102.08 pct</p>
</text>
